<header><p class="enc-kicker">Institution</p><h1 class="enc-title">Imperial Diet</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Imperial Diet, or <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/reichstag">Reichstag</a>, was the assembly of the estates of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/holy-roman-empire">Holy Roman Empire</a>, including princes, ecclesiastical rulers and imperial cities. It dealt with matters such as taxation, war and law. The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/swedish-empire">Swedish Empire</a> secured a voice in it after the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/thirty-years-war">Thirty Years' War</a> through its German territories.</p></div>
